# Student Data BLoC Layer (Refined)

## Proposed Changes

### 1. [MODIFY] [auth_user.dart](file:///c:/Users/KimoStore/church_managment_system/lib/core/models/auth_user.dart)
Add `groupId` field (nullable `Group?` for servant group assignment).

---

### 2. [NEW] RoleCubit (Global State)
**Location:** `lib/core/bloc/role_cubit/`

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Role is app-wide state, not feature-specific. Accessible from anywhere.

- `RoleState` with `AuthUser?`, `isAdmin`, `isServant`, `groupId` getters

---

### 3. [NEW] StudentDataBloc
**Location:** `lib/features/student/presentation/bloc/student_data/`

Events accept filter params (decoupled from RoleCubit):
```dart
LoadStudents({Group? filterByGroup})  // UI passes groupId from RoleCubit
CreateStudent(StudentModel)
UpdateStudent(StudentModel)
DeleteStudent(String docId)
```

---

### 4. [NEW] Firestore Seed Integration Test
**Location:** `integration_test/seed_data_test.dart`

> [!WARNING]
> Uses `flutter test` not `dart run` - cloud_firestore requires Flutter engine.

Creates: 20 students, 3 servants, 1 admin, 5 attendance records each.

---

### 5. [NEW] BLoC Tests
- `test/core/bloc/role_cubit_test.dart`
- `test/features/student/bloc/student_data_bloc_test.dart`

## Verification
```bash
flutter test test/core/bloc/ test/features/student/bloc/
flutter test integration_test/seed_data_test.dart
